  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Indo-Pacific Ministerial Forum (IPMF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The third&lt;strong&gt; EU Indo-Pacific Ministerial Forum&lt;/strong&gt; (IPMF) is planned to take place on&lt;strong&gt; 1 February 2024 &lt;/strong&gt;(morning) &lt;strong&gt;in Brussels&lt;/strong&gt;, in between the Informal FAC Defence Ministers meeting (31&lt;sup&gt;st&lt;/sup&gt; January) and the informal EU Foreign Ministers meeting (2&lt;sup&gt;nd&lt;/sup&gt; February).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
